189 │               Remove all {data.total} requirement{data.total === 1 ? "" : "s"} from the car?
190 │             </p>
191 │             <p className="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">
192 │               Their history stays in the audit trail, and their IDs won't be given out again.
193 │             </p>
194 │             <div className="mt-3 flex justify-end gap-2">
195 │               <Button size="sm" variant="ghost" onClick={reset.cancel} disabled={reset.busy}>
